{"candidateAnswer":"Early February 2023","evidence":"[D5:5 | 9:32 am on 8 February, 2023] Gina: That's awesome! I'm sure you feel great knowing your students are doing so well with dance. It's amazing what it can do for people! Oh, and btw - I've been working hard on my online store and just teamed up with a local artist for some cool designs. Check 'em out!","itemId":"urn:uuid:73f34550-4861-51d6-bf12-711dfa9ec704","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a4e21cc39a463c2f20379bff18d3e470d51daf25e73ad9599a0364513c7913ba","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Gina team up with a local artist for some cool designs?","referenceAnswer":"February, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a4e21cc39a463c2f20379bff18d3e470d51daf25e73ad9599a0364513c7913ba"}}]}